<title>NETHERLANDS: Wegener Arcade profit to grow by 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Wegener Arcade profit to grow by 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wegener Arcade, said its profit in 1996 was expected to have grown by about 16 percent and its earnings per share by about five percent.</p>
<p>The profit in 1995 was 58.7 million guilders, or 9.77 guilders per share.  </p>
<p>In the first half of 1996, net profits increased by 16.1 percent to 31.3 million guilders.</p>
<p>Turnover in 1996 was expected to have increased by 52 percent to 1,470 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
